ic Resistance.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>This large metal shield hums quietly. Small electrical sparks strike any metal objects placed near the shield.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>Talk to Dirge of Karrnath &lt;Weapon Master&gt; in the entrance room of <a href=\"/page/The_Vault_of_Night\" title=\"The Vault of Night\">the Vault of Night</a> to receive this item.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817203532\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.137 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3612/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24609/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5615/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n111.66%  135.931     41 Template:IO\n100.00%  121.739      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  121.739      1 -total\n 94.93%  115.568      1 Template:Named_Shield\n 40.22%   48.966      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 38.74%   47.156      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 35.66%   43.416      2 Templat